				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">UPDATE: READ THIS PARAGRAPH
<br />

<br />
Currently Five Rings is not taking any new applications.  We have had a large influx of applicants recently.  We need time to assess these apps fairly, get to know them well, and most importantly, mesh into the Five Rings Team.  IF you consider yourself to be HIGHLY skilled, above average in play times, over 150 AA's then SEND CATRAXYLA a tell to set up a possible officer interview.
<br />

<br />

<br />
I'll post here when applications have re-opened.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
<span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: normal"><span style="font-weight: bold">Requirements to Apply</span>:</span>
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-weight: bold"><span style="color: red">Failure to read and follow all instructions here and on the website may delay or cancel your application.  We want applicants/members who are able to read and follow directions.</span></span>
<br />

<br />
1) Level 62 with skills to that level
<br />
2) Skilled in your class
<br />
3) Skilled in the basics of raiding but willing to adapt to our methods
<br />
4) Play 5 days a week on a regular basis during our primary raid times - 6PM till Midnight EST
<br />
5) Overall game knowledge 
<br />
-Can you find Ssra, Akheva Ruins, Acrylia Caverns, etc
<br />
-What flags are needed for which planes and how to get them?
<br />
-What skills are needed/available from other classes?
<br />
6)  PoS, PoV, BoT  flags
<br />
7)  Attitude – very subjective but basically we are looking for people that seek to better themselves by bettering the guild.  Banter on F&R or ingame is highly discouraged.  
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: normal"><span style="font-weight: bold">Your Immediate Goals by which your Perma Guilding will be Evaluated</span></span>
<br />
1) Level 65 with most of your skills, aa’s, spells acquired.
<br />
2) Skilled in our methods of Raiding
<br />
3) High attendance on Raids
<br />
4) We spend time in Vex Thal, a key is highly recommended especially for loot and raid attendance/
<br />
5) Flagging is a major priority and if you are not getting flags, you will not be an asset to the guild. An applicant should obtain all tier 2 flags prior to perma-guilding status. We do try to help whenever possible.
<br />
6) Acceptance by the vast majority of permanent members without any major unresolved issues.  We are not a "family" guild which just means that we may not be best friends with each other, but we have to have respect and courtesy - anything else will not be tolerated
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: normal"><span style="font-weight: bold">Key points</span></span>
<br />
1) An applicant that applies and is a class that is saturated may have to wait for an extended period of time for full guilding.
<br />
2) AA’s determined by class so work with the members of your class to determine what is best for your class within our guild.
<br />
3) This process will probably take a month or more.  Don't get overly concerned.
<br />
4) Use your sponsor as a 5R mentor; if they are unavailable, talk to one of the officers or someone in your class.
<br />

<br />
<span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: normal"><span style="font-weight: bold">Current Need Status of Classes</span></span> – <span style="text-decoration: underline">exceptions will always be made for exceptional players:</span>
<br />
1)  Bard – Moderate
<br />
2)  Beastlord – High
<br />
3)  Cleric - Moderate
<br />
4)  Druid – High
<br />
5)  Enchanter - Moderate
<br />
6)  Magician - Low
<br />
7)  Monk - Low
<br />
8)  Necromancer - Low
<br />
9)  Paladin - Low
<br />
10) Ranger - High
<br />
11) Rogue - Low
<br />
12) ShadowKnight - Low
<br />
13) Shaman - Low
<br />
14) Warrior - Moderate
<br />
15) Wizard - Moderate
<br />

<br />
Please visit our website here: <a href="http://www.five-rings.com" target="_blank">www.five-rings.com</a>
<br />

<br />
If you like our policies etc, then post an app here telling us a little of you <span style="font-weight: bold">history, detailed play times</span>, and a <span style="font-weight: bold">magelo</span>.
<br />

<br />
Our Guild Goals, atm, are directed at the Elemental Planes. We have backflagging arrangements with some other guilds to facilitate this progression.  You should at all times, drop what you are doing ingame if a backflag mob is called by us or with another guild.  
<br />

<br />
We may guild some players who have not attained level 65 but only in certain cases that are dependant on guild needs.  You will be evaluated based on:
<br />

<br />
Attendance
<br />
Skill
<br />
Attitude
<br />
Levels/AA's.
<br />

<br />
Currently, unsponsored applicants who have been cleared to raid may join channel frcount to keep in communication with the guild movements.  You can find other applicants there, working on the guild goals hopefully.
<br />

<br />
If you have any questions, or need more information, please contact Catraxyla or any officer - Woodkinz, Ormus, Bakkal, or Alfonse</span><span class="postbody"></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
